<% content_for :title, "Depression Relapse Plan | Bipolar Sober" %>

<main class="relapse-plan-page">

  <section class="relapse-plan-hero">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <%= link_to "← ALL RELAPSE PLANS", toolbox_relapse_plans_path,
          class: "relapse-plan-back" %>

      <p class="relapse-plan-eyebrow">
        BIPOLAR SOBER / RELAPSE PLANS / DEPRESSION
      </p>

      <h1>
        <span>WHEN</span>
        <span>EVERYTHING</span>
        <span>FEELS HEAVY.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="relapse-plan-intro">
        MY SOBRIETY PLAN FOR THE LOW DAYS.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-purple">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">01 / MY EXPERIENCE</p>
      <h2>WHAT THE LOW<br>LOOKS LIKE.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write about depression and how alcohol enters the picture for you.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-black">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">02 / MY WARNING SIGNS</p>
      <h2>WHAT STARTS<br>SLIPPING?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY THOUGHTS</h3>
          <p>[Write the thoughts you recognize when you are struggling.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY DAILY LIFE</h3>
          <p>[Write your personal changes in routines, sleep, and connection.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-yellow">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">03 / THE PROMISE OF RELIEF</p>
      <h2>WHAT DO I WANT<br>TO FEEL DIFFERENT?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHAT I’M LOOKING FOR</h3>
          <p>[Write what you hope drinking will change.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHAT MY EXPERIENCE SAYS</h3>
          <p>[Write what has actually happened when you drank during depression.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-pink">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">04 / A SMALLER PLAN</p>
      <h2>WHAT CAN I<br>MANAGE TODAY?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY NEXT SMALL STEP</h3>
          <p>[Write actions that fit your capacity on a difficult day.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>CONNECTION WITHOUT THE PERFORMANCE</h3>
          <p>[Write who you can contact and what you can say.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY BACKUP</h3>
          <p>[Write what you will try if your first step or contact is unavailable.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY CARE &amp; SAFETY PLAN</h3>
          <p>[Add your agreed care instructions, support contacts, and urgent steps.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>